  "focus": "title matches /\\bair\\b|air[ _-]?(quality|pollution|monitor)|airnow|luft|qualità dell'aria|qualita dell'aria|qaria|calidad del aire|qualité de l'air|pm ?2[._ ]?5|pm ?10|pm2|particulate|fine particles|ozon|nitrogen dioxide|\\bno2\\b|no₂|nitric oxide|sulphur dioxide|sulfur dioxide|\\bso2\\b|carbon monoxide|benzene|xylene|smog|pollut|emission|\\baqi\\b|aerosol|smoke|atmosph|ατμοσφ|ρύπ|περιβαλλοντικά δεδομένα/i AND NOT title matches /sea ?water|NO2-N|NO3-N/i AND NOT (title matches /water quality|water_quality|wq_|bathing water|drinking water|(?<!data )stream|wetland|swimmab|alkalinity|phosphorus/i AND NOT title matches /\\bair\\b|air[ _-]?quality|airnow|luft/i) AND NOT title matches /corridor overlay|transport air quality corridor|transport_air/i AND NOT title matches /deprecated|depcrecated|superseded|archived/i",
